---
source: crates/argus-core/tests/redirect_uri_corpus.rs
expression: out
---
https://app.example.com/cb   [loopback=false]
  EXACT     https://app.example.com/cb

https://app.example.com/cb/   [loopback=false]
  EXACT     https://app.example.com/cb/

http://127.0.0.1/callback   [loopback=true]
  LOOPBACK  http://127.0.0.1:3118/callback

http://[::1]/callback   [loopback=true]
  LOOPBACK  http://[::1]:51234/callback

http://localhost/callback   [loopback=true]
  LOOPBACK  http://localhost:8080/callback

https://127.0.0.1/callback   [loopback=false]

com.example.app:/oauth   [loopback=false]
  EXACT     com.example.app:/oauth
